1
00:00:00,119 --> 00:00:04,379
He talks more about the caravan than about me sometimes, so I found the perfect gift.

2
00:00:04,679 --> 00:00:07,119
He loves that caravan more than I want to admit.

3
00:00:07,399 --> 00:00:12,799
So this year, I was looking for something he would actually appreciate. Not just some gadget that ends up in a drawer.

4
00:00:12,819 --> 00:00:14,859
I found a roof cover for the caravan.

5
00:00:14,939 --> 00:00:17,299
It protects the roof when it's parked outside over the winter.

6
00:00:17,359 --> 00:00:18,719
He was genuinely happy.

7
00:00:18,779 --> 00:00:25,760
Not just politely happy, but truly happy. For once, I gave him something he actually uses every winter.

8
00:00:25,799 --> 00:00:29,459
The best gift is the one that shows you get what they care about.
